# Registries whose images the node of the local cluster pulls through the zot
# mirror (ADR-011, condition 10): one line per registry, its name as images
# write it, then the upstream that zot syncs from on demand. The hosts.toml
# files of certs.d/ and the sync entries of zot/config.json derive from this
# list; S13 keeps them in step.
#
# Steps 6 to 8 pull from docker.io only: Envoy Gateway (ADR-005) and Postgres
# (ADR-012); so does the cache of step 19, valkey/valkey (ADR-015, condition
# 1). Flux (ghcr.io, step 12) adds its registry here, once the mounting with
# several upstreams is tried (RS-13).
# Images that the engine pulls itself, the node image and the zot image, do
# not go through the mirror.
docker.io https://index.docker.io
